                    <p class="eyebrow">THE DIVINE DRIVER</p>
                    <h2>Get ready! You’re about to obtain supernatural graph database powers.</h2>
                    <p>
                        Drivine maps graphs to objects by composition. Declare the view a use case needs, made of node fragments
                        and the relationships between them, and Drivine writes the statement. When you would rather write the
                        Cypher yourself, the persistence manager is still there.
                    </p>
